{#- Site-wide "your content partner" banner, just above the footer on every page (included from footer.njk).
    Left: eyebrow, headline, intro, what we do, and a Contact us button (to /contact). Right: four stat cards.
    Every claim is checkable on the site: the KOL and client counts come from the CMS (KOL Hub, Clients),
    the congresses from our micro case studies and insights.
    Styles: "Partner banner" in css/site.css. -#}
{%- set kolCount = ((experts | published | length) / 10) | round(0, "floor") * 10 %}
{%- set clientCount = ((clients | published | length) / 5) | round(0, "floor") * 5 %}
<section class="partner-banner" aria-labelledby="partner-banner-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="partner-banner_grid">
      <div class="partner-banner_copy">
        <p class="partner-banner_eyebrow">Your content partner</p>
        <h2 id="partner-banner-title" class="partner-banner_title">Work with a studio dedicated to <span class="partner-banner_accent">medtech</span></h2>
        <p class="partner-banner_intro">We're not a generalist production company learning your field. Made Clear is an award-winning content agency built around medtech and interventional medicine, with strategy, creative, production and distribution under one roof, for the clinicians, buyers and patients you need to reach.</p>
        <ul role="list" class="partner-banner_list">
          <li><a href="/services/medical-film-and-documentary">Film and documentary production</a>, from patient stories to KOL interviews</li>
          <li><a href="/services/vr-experiences">VR specialists</a>: immersive medical education for booths and sales teams</li>
          <li><a href="/services/on-site-congress-and-event-production">Congress production</a> at TCT, EuroPCR, ESC, ACC, SCAI and CIRSE</li>
          <li><a href="/services/live-cases">Live cases</a> filmed and broadcast from the cath lab</li>
          <li><a href="/services/campaign-strategy">Campaign</a> and <a href="/services#strategy">brand strategy</a>, from launch to adoption</li>
          <li><a href="/services/platform-distribution-and-performance">Social media</a> and distribution that reaches clinicians</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="partner-banner_actions">
          <a href="/contact" class="button primary w-inline-block"><div>Contact us</div><div class="hover-button-blur"></div></a>
          <a href="mailto:hello@madeclearstudios.com" class="partner-banner_email">or email hello@madeclearstudios.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul role="list" class="partner-banner_stats">
        <li class="partner-banner_stat"><span class="partner-banner_value">{{ kolCount }}+</span><p><strong>KOLs filmed and worked with</strong>, from interventional cardiology to structural heart</p></li>
        <li class="partner-banner_stat"><span class="partner-banner_value">6</span><p><strong>Global congresses covered</strong>: TCT, EuroPCR, ESC, ACC, SCAI and CIRSE</p></li>
        <li class="partner-banner_stat"><span class="partner-banner_value partner-banner_icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20.5s-7.5-4.6-9.4-9.3C1.3 7.9 3.4 4.5 6.9 4.5c2.1 0 3.6 1.2 5.1 3.1 1.5-1.9 3-3.1 5.1-3.1 3.5 0 5.6 3.4 4.3 6.7-1.9 4.7-9.4 9.3-9.4 9.3z"/><path d="M3.5 12h4l1.8-3 2.6 6 2-4h6.6"/></svg></span><p><strong>Deep roots in cardiology</strong>, now trusted by some of the biggest names in healthcare and medtech marketing</p></li>
        <li class="partner-banner_stat"><span class="partner-banner_value">{{ clientCount }}+</span><p><strong>Clients trust Made Clear</strong>, including Abbott, Philips, Medtronic and Johnson &amp; Johnson</p></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
